OL,3,GNEWSACalls for county-level vote on
OL,4,Astreetlights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has been asked to hold a
OL,7,F"county-level vote" on its decision to
OL,8,Fturn off streetlights overnight.
OL,10,FOut of 56,000 streetlights, Cornwall
OL,11,FCouncil switches off 35,345 between
OL,12,Fmidnight and 05:00. Since
OL,13,Fimplementation, decisions on 160 lights
OL,14,Fhave been reversed.
OL,16,FTruro and Falmouth Labour MP Jayne
OL,17,FKirkham, along with several local
OL,18,Fcouncils, opposed the switch-off,
OL,19,Fasking the unitary authority to reverse
OL,20,Fthe decision, particularly in areas
OL,21,Fwith a busy nightlife.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
